    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: the HQ answers an Engineers request (D-2, CE-2442, DESIGN_Minefields §13). A Friend 'Squad' (Man Leader + Man 1-3) stands at (111-117, 78-82), 15 m short of 'Field B' (an own AP field Friend knows from the start, at (130-150, 50-110)), running MinefieldAhead: every man holds and it REQUESTS ENGINEERS at its position, up the chain to its 'HQ' (SupportCommand). (The squad starts in the reaction: a march's route skirts the field's edge today - CE-2447.) The HQ's 'Engineers' unit (a TKB 116 'Clearer', 'Sapper 3' who supports by fire, and the crossing 'Sapper Team' of 'Sapper 1-2', at (56-78, 60-64) - the clearer 18 m clear of the sappers, outside its hull)) is the free engineer asset; the side knows the field in full, so the HQ orders the unit to BREACH from the request's point to the far side along the squad's line: support by fire, the clearer cuts the lane (ClearLane), the Sapper Team crosses (CrossLane). Judge: (1) the squad reacts MinefieldAhead; (2) the Engineers run Breach; (3) the Clearer runs ClearLane; (4) the Sapper Team runs CrossLane; (5) nobody is hurt; (6) the squad never runs the crossing drill. Fail: no answer, the engineers sent to reinforce, a blast. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh mf-engineers-answer"
  },
